      "content": "ok i get what you mean about the antidote thing but my doctor is always so busy and i hate having to wait weeks for an appointment just to ask about a simple vitamin. if i just took a small dose, like 50mcg or something very low, would that be safe enough that it wouldn't really change my blood levels? i just really want to make sure my bones are okay without having to go in for more blood tests every time i change something.",
